      "value": "@{5a565acbb301553d0104ba88|full_name}: I'm pretty sure that just like the mod, this is a locally spawned actual mirror, not a camera. It's just using the various mirror settings. the point being that it's a object spawned only for you, like how the mod did and how the modloader itself had a local-only flashlight. Making them spawn for everyone would be complicated and quite possible laggy or bothersome to others. You're not gonna get a group of people to agree to chill by one person's mirror, because if they leave or move there goes the mirror. It's not the same as a world mirror",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
