  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Give us an option to set our Personal Mirror i world space as a Public Mirror.\nThis will allow people the social option for someone to define a hangout location anywhere in the map by dropping a public mirror there.\nThe way it would function is like this:\nPlayer A can set their mirror to Public, forcing it to be a worldspace mirror.\nAll other players will see it as just a \"stand\" or a \"pole\" with the user's name by it (like cameras do) until they walk up to it and enable the mirror, thus expanding it to full size. Or they can hide the stand even further to a circle on the ground. That circle can also work as a button to show it again. Or these options could be put on a player's profile menu.\nOptions to adjust the masking of the mirror or turn it off will appear as buttons on the side for other players.\nIt's a feature that just makes sense to have, and now is the time to bundle it as part of the personal mirror.\nNo one has ever thought of this b4, hope u like it",
